  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Lyophilic sols are quite stable and cannot be easily coagulated. Lyophobic sols need stabilising agents for their preservation.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Property</td>\t\t\t<td>Lyophilic colloids</td>\t\t\t<td>Lyophobic colloids</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>Stability</td>\t\t\t<td>These are very stable</td>\t\t\t<td>These are unstable and require traces of stabilizers</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p>",
